01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
A sequel to the 2001 film Super Troopers, the film was written by and stars the Broken Lizard comedy team,
made up of Chandrasekhar, Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Paul Soter and Erik Stolhanske.

13
